{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34166","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 练渎 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 练渎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越恃君子衆，大将压全吴。\n吴将派天泽，以练舟师徒。\n一镜止千里，支流忽然迂。\n苍匳朿洪波，坐似冯夷躯。\n战舰百万辈，浮宫三十余。\n平川盛丁宁，绝岛分储胥。\n凤押半鹤膝，锦杠杂肥胡。\n香烟与杀气，浩浩随风驱。\n弹射尽高鸟，杯觥醉潜鱼。\n山灵恐见鞭，水府愁爲墟。\n兵利德日削，反爲雠国屠。\n至今钩镞残，尚与泥沙俱。\n照此月倍苦，来兹烟亦孤。\n丁魂尚有泪，合洒青枫枯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}